            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS DINOSAUR HUNT?</h2><br>Dinosaur Hunt is a chaotic first person shooter that confronts heavily armed players with the most horrifying creatures that ever roamed the earth: Dinosaurs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SETTING</h2><br>The world of Dinosaurs is a ride that you will never forget<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/401190/extras/ee355141022a576f5f1601ed09883efb.avif?t=1641647940\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PLOT</h2><br>The story is mindblowing and will make you crying in the corner<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/401190/extras/df462583e37a669d282f514a90103530.avif?t=1641647940\" width=640 height=480 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>1081 Achievements - thats right 1081 of them. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/401190/extras/46d7bb0108a030fc1377321fc92bc92d.avif?t=1641647940\" width=800 height=578 /></span>",
